specifications, allowing Azure-specific credentials to be validated and 
forwarded through milvus-storage. It enforces strict validation of Azure 
credential broker parameters and mutual exclusivity with other credential modes.
The PR also pins the corresponding milvus-storage commit and includes 
comprehensive test coverage covering positive and negative cases for the new 
credential mode.

